{
  "name": "gemma-search",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "本地素材库语义检索（EmbeddingGemma 2）· 引擎与桌面应用",
  "main": "app/main/bootstrap.cjs",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "test": "node --test --test-isolation=none \"tests/*.test.mjs\"",
    "test:watch": "node --test --watch --test-isolation=none \"tests/*.test.mjs\""
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@huggingface/transformers": "^4.3.1",
    "@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog": "^1.1.24",
    "@radix-ui/react-checkbox": "^1.3.12",
    "@radix-ui/react-dialog": "^1.2.0",
    "@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu": "^2.1.25",
    "@radix-ui/react-label": "^2.1.16",
    "@radix-ui/react-popover": "^1.2.0",
    "@radix-ui/react-select": "^2.3.8",
    "@radix-ui/react-slot": "^1.4.0",
    "@radix-ui/react-switch": "^1.3.8",
    "@radix-ui/react-tabs": "^1.1.22",
    "@radix-ui/react-toast": "^1.2.24",
    "@radix-ui/react-tooltip": "^1.3.0",
    "@tanstack/react-virtual": "^3.14.14",
    "bmp-js": "^0.1.0",
    "class-variance-authority": "^0.7.1",
    "clsx": "^2.1.1",
    "lucide-react": "^1.55.0",
    "react": "^19.3.0",
    "react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "tailwind-merge": "^3.7.0",
    "zod": "^4.6.5",
    "zustand": "^5.0.15"
  },
  "//": [
    "P1 引擎刻意**零依赖**：只用 Node 内置能力（node:test / node:crypto / node:fs）。",
    "理由一：core/ 必须传输无关，零依赖是这一点的最强形式（也不可能 import electron）。",
    "理由二：受限沙箱下 `npm install` 会因 npm 用管道捕获子进程输出而 EPERM。",
    "zod 与 electron 属 P2（IPC 参数校验与外壳），届时再装。"
  ],
  "devDependencies": {
    "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.3.3",
    "@types/node": "^26.6.5",
    "@types/react": "^19.3.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "electron": "^44.7.0",
    "electron-builder": "^26.15.3",
    "electron-vite": "^5.0.0",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.3.3",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2",
    "vite": "^7.3.7",
    "vitest": "^5.0.3"
  }
}
